{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_title", "source_sha256": "196c9a59b5aad1ec94ca98e19fa7de9b8affb111131caaf878e183041591e3e4", "ja": "杏奈流、チルアウト法", "zh": "杏奈流，放松法", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_synopsis", "source_sha256": "75fa4bc2170380f337a50434035b5c7287faef386446398a9232d0083390335a", "ja": "公演初日。劇場外の会場ということもあり、\n緊張した面持ちのアイドル達。ゲームをして\nリラックスしたいと言う杏奈に、プロデュー\nサーはゲーム機を渡す。みんなでプレイして\nリラックス、いざステージへ！", "zh": "演出首日。由于是在剧场外的会场，  \n偶像们都显得有些紧张。杏奈说想玩游戏放松一下，  \n制作人便把游戏机递给了她。大家一起玩游戏  \n放松心情，然后登上舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e1d6fa8925ad8f0267992f781ec4ce453bbce43d3b5fac13bd0116fc78dde6fc", "ja": "（いよいよ迎えた公演初日。しっかり準備してきたし、\n心配はしていない……みんな、信じてるぞ！）", "zh": "（终于迎来了公演首日。我们已经做好了充分准备，不用担心……我相信大家！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "3e170599607621ab5d171430b61bf9e42a5d1f6c72196488ebceca429f5cde51", "ja": "もうすぐ本番だね……。\nうーっ、なんだか、すっごくどきどきしてきた！", "zh": "马上就要正式演出了呢……\n呜——不知怎么的，心跳得好厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "12f2c74b534e8edd52af54bd87ab794ab776906c31e59d0d942253f375d50ac8", "ja": "劇場外の会場って、やっぱり緊張するわよね。\nもちろん、いい意味でだけど！", "zh": "剧场外的会场，果然还是会让人紧张呢。\n当然，是好的那种意义上啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "318607f843704103a0bd9bcba0baacdda347ecdeefa01587516c195e7640dc29", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、育ちゃん！　私たち、お昼ごはんを\nモリモリ食べたし！　きっと実力を発揮できるよ！", "zh": "没事的，育！我们午饭吃得\n饱饱的呢！一定能发挥出实力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "2b41e04efd074b38b943e617830202bc90ad27655d802e141f26406048786b31", "ja": "そうだといいけどなぁ。\n……杏奈さんはどう？", "zh": "希望如此就好了。\n……杏奈，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "1b2db52d5dbaba4fadd1c2244cd08cd9da0b4a919a36f753a270a8111f5cd945", "ja": "んと……杏奈は……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "c5e77b8bced78185af22045ac0f15a47efb43724f8be7e4dc9d1a2dded37303c", "ja": "……。\nゲーム、やりたい……。", "zh": "……  \n想玩游戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "7e8d5a2c27bbea3f0b1eb00669648d2656741eed2cd5620d2728b03a3b94b61e", "ja": "ええっ！？　ゲームって……今？", "zh": "诶！？你说游戏……现在？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "afd35d4a706455b54db5b53ba3679fa894742ff4e6f01ac357ddff9b3aef4af5", "ja": "ん……ドキドキして、落ち着かない、から……。\nゲームすると、杏奈、リラックスできる……。", "zh": "嗯……因为心里怦怦直跳，静不下来……  \n玩游戏的话，杏奈就能放松……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_1009", "source_sha256": "b1fed7c5b3925fa2a9bff714eda88a6e341321ce8830b5881e45f0c7404977bf", "ja": "ゲーム機を渡す", "zh": "递出游戏机", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2000_p", "source_sha256": "794b534f43f1b5f5d69dad35e5c1a24801cd5040be90e14dd8ef88d35fa3919b", "ja": "ほら。そう言い出すかなと思って、\n持ってきておいたぞ。", "zh": "给。想着你可能会这么说，我就提前带来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2001_024ann", "source_sha256": "4b079368ed3dbbc23146d3a4219acd07c47d9b9dc70b7f2ad7dd29351e7b9063", "ja": "……！　{$P$}さん、ありがとう。\n杏奈のこと……わかっててくれて……。", "zh": "……！　{$P$}先生，谢谢你。\n这么懂……杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2002_024ann", "source_sha256": "b8be16307cea899870307ef4b42540087f387931906e3ba0cbf811daaba819c7", "ja": "じゃあ、杏奈、あっちでやってる、ね……。\n……えへへ。", "zh": "那杏奈去那边玩了哦……。\n……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2003_007ior", "source_sha256": "043878088d5063c1b7b32d2eb30bfd8e0d85a88fadcb4901245157bc3932f728", "ja": "本番直前にゲームなんて、私だったら混乱しそう……。\n杏奈って、こういうところ大物よね～。", "zh": "临上场前居然还在玩游戏，要是我的话肯定会慌吧……\n杏奈在这种时候还真是沉得住气呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2004_019min", "source_sha256": "87df7f95427aa90714e5597ff1b207e90f5888dab437e9e6efd7c5da00f80d80", "ja": "だね！　私も見習いたいなぁ……ねえ杏奈ちゃん、\n格ゲーってある？　もしあったら、対戦したいな！", "zh": "对呀！我也想向她学习……对了，杏奈，有格斗游戏吗？要是有的话，我想和你对战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2005_030iku", "source_sha256": "fb9c8f1ec780a95683162119af1aa2ad49b660e9ccd52312198739b5a4097ba5", "ja": "ふふっ……なんだかいつも通りすぎて、\nわたしもリラックスできちゃったかも！", "zh": "嘿嘿……感觉实在是太一如既往了，\n我好像也放松下来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2006_null", "source_sha256": "b51dfd95602ddeba2076b904866bddd2d33de5044a97d39d914d7a5836a1edaa", "ja": "そして…………", "zh": "然后…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2007_030iku", "source_sha256": "98906a5d636d88f5c20bba6a5de39ac1e9b65537f542f21c237656eb683ffe10", "ja": "ねえねえ、みんな！　今日はじめて、\nわたしたちの公演に来てくれたひと、手をあげてみて！", "zh": "大家大家！今天第一次来看我们公演的人，请举一下手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2008_audience", "source_sha256": "b6408cd80751085207d4df389a552a36f40b69f149a4494aea6266c4ee833076", "ja": "はーい！！！！", "zh": "好的！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2009_007ior", "source_sha256": "a3b7f295d99af1e2358d24d3d151aed32e0f45c9d47e303189dc82ba60150ffd", "ja": "あら、すっごくたくさんいるのね！\n伊織ちゃん、みんなに会えて嬉しいでーすっ♪", "zh": "哎呀，来了好多人呢！\n小伊织能见到大家，好开心哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2010_019min", "source_sha256": "2ff3a03df0f556c7c0364c0b792327bede9383cacb8e87c95448e1bebd04646f", "ja": "今日、はじめましてのみなさんは、\n名前だけでも覚えていってくださいねー！", "zh": "今天，第一次见面的各位，请至少记住名字再走哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2011_024ann", "source_sha256": "09e2fdfa87db0e98a02b4067e9ccb75e4ee623df87cc0b5b714dcc02c595b3ba", "ja": "また杏奈たちに会いたいって思ったら、劇場に来てね！\nもうすぐリニューアルだから！　約束っ☆", "zh": "要是想再见到杏奈她们，就来剧场玩吧！\n马上就要重新开张了哦！说好了哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_12_2012_p", "source_sha256": "8ca13fb49ada5ffafed71554fd9466ac797d340341449cfd8465c75d883fb094", "ja": "（よし！　いい感じのスタートが切れたな。\nこの調子で、続きたいところだ）", "zh": "（好！开了个不错的头。\n照这个势头继续下去就好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
